          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "result-0"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.95
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The medical entrance exam was held on May 3, but the system operator was forced to respond after a catalytic communication revealed evidence of a manipulated outcome. This triggered the referral of the insider group of question creators to the investigative agency, leading to arrests made in the case. The outcome of the events was the cancellation of the exam and a scheduled future event for re-examination on June 21.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Magician",
        "fragments": [
          "how-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "result-0",
          "result-2"
